OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells, later in the night
OL,7,Fscattered showers arrive along the
OL,8,Fcoast, perhaps pushing showers a
OL,9,Flittle way inland. Remaining breezy
OL,10,Falong the coast. Frost patches
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FLargely dry initially with
OL,14,Fsunny spells, but scattered coastal
OL,15,Fshowers. Through the day showers
OL,16,Fextend further west and cloudier
OL,17,Fconditions develop, although
OL,18,FDerbyshire likely remains dry. Coastal
OL,19,Fareas become windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
